L1 Knowledge Base - Issue 1 (Login)
v 1.0, 07/08/2026, status : Draft

Issue
Sign-in is very slow or does not complete on Floor 6.

Reassurance
Your files and data are safe. This issue affects access speed, not stored documents.

What you can safely do
1. Wait 2 to 3 minutes on the sign-in screen.
2. If nothing changes, restart your computer once.
3. Sign in again and wait up to 3 minutes.
4. If still slow or failed, stop repeated restarts.
5. Contact the Service Desk.

Details to provide in the ticket
- Full name
- Team and floor/location
- Computer name (if known)
- Exact time issue happened
- What appeared on screen
- Whether restart was tried
- Whether second sign-in worked
- Screenshot/photo (if possible)

Contact the service desk if...
Sign-in takes more than 3 minutes, fails again after one restart, or desktop access is not possible.
